acceptance:
  - `.agentic-template/bin/project test` passes
  - `.agentic-template/bin/project check` passes
  - `.agentic-template/bin/project ready` passes if time permits
  - no provider-specific imports appear outside `adapters/langchain4j`
  - conceptual crossover is not a mutation operator enum value
  - all required deterministic behavior cases hard-gate promotion before weighted fitness scoring

non_goals:
  - no live OpenAI or LangChain4j provider factory in this slice
  - no Git promotion ref implementation
  - no SQLite schema or metadata change
  - no AST mutation, LSP integration, vector store, distributed workers or deployment
  - no raw Git diff crossover
  - do not replace the existing `MutationEvaluationLoop` orchestration unless the tests force a narrow seam

